ned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118552#pullrequestreview-4299412065","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118552","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T15:38:59Z"},{"id":4299687195,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAEgFGw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"ff35cf75a96e9a1d5e24c46cf1b0ab05a1aee952","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"I don't like looking at yellow walls, so LGTM 👍\n\nTwo notes:\n- I'm conflicted on the situation around default values in the entire GDScript stack. Initializing `header_end_line` to `0` might be just as bad as not initializing it. Both can lead to invalid states. Not really solvable in the current model around allocating nodes though. So probably fine.\n\n- This is another PR that shows, that it would make sense to pack position and range info into dedicated structs. I'm explicitly not asking for it though, since I'm planning to introduce structs for that as part of my `EditorLanguage` effort. I'd rather integrate the unified structs into GDScript code at a later point, than run with two different structs.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118552#pullrequestreview-4299687195","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118552","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T16:23:24Z"}]